{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "44f35c6a-b3d2-898b-9661-8f4da371db87",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T15:30:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about plowing? I'm on Dixon Street, 77 Dixon, up in the North End?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 77 Dixon. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So after the snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday, the plow came through once and like, left this big heavy wall at the end of the street? And it's all slush and ice now, so it's totally packed in. Can you get a plow to come back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that wet stuff gets heavy and then it freezes up. I can put in a request for a return pass on Dixon. Is it the whole block or just the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the corner and the part by the hydrant? The rest is, like, passable. Sorry, hold on. [pause] No, buddy, that's not a toy. Give me, okay. Sorry, my toddler keeps grabbing the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I've got kids' hands in my ear plenty. So corner and the hydrant side of 77 Dixon. I've got that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And one more thing, do you know when the snow parking ban lifts? Like, is it still on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check. [pause] Okay, it's been lifted for most streets as of this morning, but if crews come back through for your corner, you'll want to keep cars off that stretch until they're done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. So just keep the car off the corner till they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Do you want a call back number on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0160. Crews should get to it in the next day or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet, Mr. Vieira. Take care."
    }
  ],
